 Experience","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://map.hsc.edu/","access_notes":"Do not enter or use course elements without College authorization, scheduled programming, and required supervision.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"hsc-first-weekend-08-bortz-library","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Walter M. Bortz III Library","title":"Locate Bortz Library Before Classes","subtitle":"Saturday · Learn where academic support is based","notes":"Find the entrance, bookmark the library’s current schedule, and note the adjacent academic-support and technology resources for Monday.","short_summary":"A brief orientation now reduces friction when coursework and academic appointments begin.","evidence_claim":"The official campus map identifies Bortz Library as an academic facility and student-service destination and associates it with the Office of Academic Success and Fuqua computing facilities.","source_url":"https://map.hsc.edu/","source_title":"Hampden-Sydney College Interactive Campus Map","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://map.hsc.edu/","access_notes":"Weekend interior access and service hours are not established by the cited map; verify the library’s live schedule before entering.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"hsc-first-weekend-09-leggett-pool","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Leggett Pool","title":"Plan a Sunday Swim at Leggett Pool","subtitle":"Sunday · Use the live TigeRec schedule before leaving","notes":"Check the same-day schedule, pack appropriate swim gear, enter through the patio doors, and complete the required staff check-in.","short_summary":"A scheduled swim offers an active Sunday option with clearly documented eligibility and entry procedures."